# union fixtures, multirate by agents with no multirate seam), 0 uncompared.
# tests/test_tier45_region_assembly.py asserts the pair and the count.
!out/w189/control_tier49.json
!out/w189/compare_before1_vs_tier49.json
# Tier 46 (W172, the joining seams and the O(K) count across them). JSON only:
